{"3979580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ARBITER 131", "steam_appid": 3979580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4948030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arbiter 131 is a gritty, story-driven, real-time tactical game set in the corporate megacity of Arkadia. Take the lead of Arkadia’s Social Moderation Team 131 and enforce corporate rule with an iron fist... or don’t.  Disobey, rebel, fight back. Discover branching narratives, moral dilemmas, and challenging tactical scenarios. Everything is possible, and every order matters. What will you choose, Arbiter? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC CAMPAIGN </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/f1204388495fc1ef4e5036ba547f29fd.poster.avif?t=1787858234\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/f1204388495fc1ef4e5036ba547f29fd.webm?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/f1204388495fc1ef4e5036ba547f29fd.mp4?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every order, every decision, every mistake shapes the world around you in a dynamic, story-rich, single-player campaign. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tracks how you handle each scenario and adjusts the narrative organically: there are no binary choices, everything is decided through your gameplay alone.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute orders efficiently and be rewarded for it, or follow your own morals and face the consequences. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULLY DIEGETIC</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/473fd6e1fdf2eb6cb1d3606029057827.poster.avif?t=1787858234\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/473fd6e1fdf2eb6cb1d3606029057827.webm?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/473fd6e1fdf2eb6cb1d3606029057827.mp4?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully diegetic. There are no see-through walls, God-like cameras, or fog of war. You control your forces from a set of drone feeds and bodycam footage. You can only see what they see.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones are real entities in the game world. They can be spotted and destroyed. You will have to navigate through complex environments carefully, avoid detection, and fight to maintain situational awareness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access your operators' bodycams at any moment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arkadia, intel is your greatest weapon. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IN-DEPTH PLANNING</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/786d5a70c3a16fc265761b27b19bf24f.poster.avif?t=1787858234\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/786d5a70c3a16fc265761b27b19bf24f.webm?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/786d5a70c3a16fc265761b27b19bf24f.mp4?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Arkadia Control System lets you carefully plan each operation. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw paths, breach walls and doors, sync unit movements, and coordinate your team. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare a detailed plan in advance, tweak your orders in real time, or improvise on the fly for total tactical freedom. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/26a7fa208ad8ce1b1946335738324d3b.poster.avif?t=1787858234\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/26a7fa208ad8ce1b1946335738324d3b.webm?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/26a7fa208ad8ce1b1946335738324d3b.mp4?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparation is key.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match weapons, armor, and gadgets.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your team’s loadout to each operation.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and silent, heavy and resilient, or less lethal: experiment until you find the perfect playstyle. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A LIFE-LIKE WORLD</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/6bc773e84bf953ecbdfbe1b17122dfb1.poster.avif?t=1787858234\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/6bc773e84bf953ecbdfbe1b17122dfb1.webm?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979580/extras/6bc773e84bf953ecbdfbe1b17122dfb1.mp4?t=1787858234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drone scanner can pull private data on every device and person on the map.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique identity waiting to be uncovered.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Were the mission briefings honest, or corporate propaganda? Piece the truth together and inform your choices. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and join our Discord to receive weekly progress updates!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arbiter 131 is a gritty, story-driven, real-time tactical game set in the corporate megacity of Arkadia. Take the lead of Arkadia’s Social Moderation Team 131 and enforce corporate rule with an iron fist... or don’t.  Disobey, rebel, fight back. Discover branching narratives, moral dilemmas, and challenging tactical scenarios. Everything is possible, and every order matt